{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1178335-other-mage20-books","id":1178335,"title":"Other Mage20 books?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-22T21:24:32-08:00","id":1178335,"title":"Other Mage20 books?","content":"I'm trying to remember what hasn't come out yet. There's an M20 Book of Madness and an M20 Guide to the Technocracy still to come, right? Those were kickstarter stretchgoals weren't they?<br /> <br /> There's also a Victorian Age Mage book theoretically some degree of in the works.<br /> <br /> Is there anything else I'm forgetting?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T22:17:40-08:00","id":1178361,"title":"","content":"It's been mentioned that after the Technocracy Reloaded book there is going to be a Digital Web 3.0. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11535-furoan","name":"Furoan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T23:06:51-08:00","id":1178375,"title":"","content":"Gods Monsters and other Strangeness aka more of why m20 isn't a 2000 page book. Book of the Fallen, Technocracy Reloaded, Victorian Age and Digitial web 3.0 have variously been announced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-23T06:56:29-08:00","id":1178425,"title":"","content":"Interestingly enough Mage Victorian Age has been added to the 1st Draft section of product advancement on the Monday Meeting Notes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T07:35:37-08:00","id":1178781,"title":"","content":"You can find the full list here: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/schedule/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/schedule/</a><br /> <br /> I'm really looking forward to getting my hands on Gods, Monsters, and Other Familiar Strangers <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23636-umsakis","name":"Umsakis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T10:40:49-08:00","id":1178862,"title":"","content":"It really should just be \u201cGods and Monsters\u201d, with \u201cand other Familiar Strangers\u201d as a subtitle. But whatever. The M20 core is <b>M20</b>, <b>HDYDT</b>, <b>Book of Secrets</b>, and <b>GM&amp;OFS</b>, the last of which hasn't been published yet. <br /> <br /> Faction-based supplements in the works are <b>Book of the Fallen</b> (for the Nephandi) and <b>Technocracy Reloaded</b>; as far as I know, nothing has been said about an M20 <b>Book of Madness</b>. And frankly, I'd rather see supplements for the Disparates and maybe the Traditions first. <br /> <br /> <b>Digital Web 3.0</b> was mentioned off-hand during the development of M20, and has subsequently been indicated that they won't start on it until after <b>Technocracy Reloaded</b> is out; so for the time being, I'm leery of considering it a future supplement. OTOH, Victorian Mage is a book that I'm really looking forward to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver"